<title>USA: TABLE - Archibald Candy Corp sells $100 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Archibald Candy Corp sells $100 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a private placement of $100 million in junk bonds from Archibald Candy Corp was priced on Friday via lead manager Jefferies &amp; Co Inc, according to market sources.</p>
<p>The deal was increased from an original size of $85 million.</p>
<p>BORROWER ARCHIBALD CANDY CORP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 10.25 PCT  MATURITY 7/1/04</p>
<p>TYPE SR SEC NOTES  ISS PRICE 100     FIRST PAY DATE 1/1/98</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 10.25 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD +385 BPS   CALLABLE NON-CALLABLE FOR</p>
<p>							    FOUR YEARS</p>
<p>NOTES: THREE-YEAR EQUITY CALL FOR 33 PERCENT OF THE ISSUE AT 110.25.</p>
<p>(( -- U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1662 ))</p>
</text>
